# List models
Shows all available models, including creation time and owner.
## Endpoint
`GET https://api.stepfun.ai/v1/models`
## Request parameters
None.
## Response
Returns a list of [Model objects](https://platform.stepfun.ai/docs/en/api-reference/models/object.md).
## Example
